              "headerNote": "All three checks passed because the sender owns inboxly.example. A pass tells you which domain sent it, not that it's Julian.",
              "ifTrusted": "£6,750 would go to an account the sender controls.",
              "reportReply": "Thanks. Julian didn't send it, and his real address is on merrinsallow.example."
            }
          },
          {
